docs {
  # Update Lucky Draw (Creator)

  **Method:** `PATCH`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/groups/:groupID/draws/:drawID`
  **Auth:** Required

  ## Description

  Partially updates a DRAFT draw. Only its creator, while still an active member with an active account, may edit it. At least title or candidates must be supplied with a non-null value.

  Omitted or null fields are unchanged. Supplying candidates replaces the complete text/weight array; it is not a per-item patch. At least two candidates must remain and all create-time validation rules apply.

  A completed draw cannot be edited. Edits and execution are serialized by a database row lock. If execution finishes first, this endpoint returns DRAW_COMPLETED. The group must be active.

  All endpoints require an ACTIVE account and ACTIVE membership in this group. Text candidates are not people or memberships. There is no deletion endpoint.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |

  ### Path Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive BIGINT group ID; variable `drawGroupId` |
  | `drawID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive BIGINT draw ID; variable `drawId` |

  Path IDs must be from 1 to 9223372036854775807.

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | title | string | Optional | 1 to 200 Unicode characters after trimming. |
  | candidates | array of objects | Optional | Replaces all candidates; same rules as Create Lucky Draw. |

  ```json
  {
    "title": "Updated dinner choice",
    "candidates": [
      {
        "title": "Pizza",
        "weight": 2
      },
      {
        "title": "Kebab",
        "weight": 3
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 701,
      "group_id": 10,
      "created_by_member_id": 30,
      "title": "Updated dinner choice",
      "status": "DRAFT",
      "is_frozen": false,
      "result": null,
      "completed_at": null,
      "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-11T10:00:00Z",
      "candidates": [
        {
          "title": "Pizza",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "title": "Kebab",
          "weight": 3
        }
      ],
      "total_weight": 5
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  Errors use the standard Auth, Friendships and Polls envelope. Authentication and malformed HTTP input are validated before service rules. An inactive group is checked before loading a draw for a write, so DRAW_GROUP_INACTIVE can precede draw state or creator errors.

  | HTTP | code | error | When |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | 400 | `BAD_REQUEST` | bad request payload or parameters | Invalid JSON, field type, title, empty update, path ID, status filter or pagination. |
  | 401 | `MISSING_TOKEN` | authorization token is missing | A Bearer access token is required. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_INVALID` | authorization token is invalid | The token is invalid or not an access token. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_EXPIRED` | authorization token has expired | The access token expired. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_REVOKED` | authorization token has been revoked | The access token is blacklisted. |
  | 403 | `USER_INACTIVE` | user account is deactivated | The caller account is inactive. |
  | 403 | `DRAW_FORBIDDEN` | only active group members can access this lucky draw | The caller is not an active member of this group, or has left it. |
  | 404 | `USER_NOT_FOUND` | user not found | The caller no longer exists or has been soft-deleted. |
  | 404 | `GROUP_NOT_FOUND` | group not found | The group does not exist or has been soft-deleted. |
  | 500 | `INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` | an internal server error occurred | Persistence, transaction, random generation or authentication infrastructure failed; internal causes are not returned. |
  | 404 | `DRAW_NOT_FOUND` | lucky draw not found | The ID does not exist, is soft-deleted, or belongs to a different group. |
  | 403 | `DRAW_CREATOR_REQUIRED` | only the lucky draw creator can perform this action | The active member is not this draw's creator; owners and administrators have no override. |
  | 409 | `DRAW_GROUP_INACTIVE` | lucky draws cannot be changed while the group is inactive | The group is inactive; writes are frozen. |
  | 400 | `DRAW_INVALID_CANDIDATES` | provide 2 to 100 candidates with non-empty titles of at most 255 characters and integer weights from 1 to 1000000 | Candidate content failed service validation; DTO validation failures return BAD_REQUEST. |
  | 400 | `DRAW_DUPLICATE_CANDIDATES` | lucky draw candidate titles must be unique | Two titles match after trimming and conversion to lowercase. |
  | 409 | `DRAW_COMPLETED` | a completed lucky draw cannot be edited | The draw has already run. |

  **Example: 403**

  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "code": "DRAW_FORBIDDEN",
    "error": "only active group members can access this lucky draw"
  }
  ```
}
